ет","polkit","Гость","cgroup"],"captions":["Без polkit сокет RW открыт только root, сокет RO всем","С polkit действие org.libvirt.unix.manage; админов обычно кладут в группу libvirt","Гость работает от qemu (Debian и Ubuntu: libvirt-qemu), права образов важны","Скоуп гостя в machine.slice; лимиты: virsh schedinfo, memtune, blkiotune"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"сокет RW: root; RO: все","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"сокет RW: root; RO: все","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"polkit: org.libvirt.unix.manage","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"сокет RW: root; RO: все","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"polkit: org.libvirt.unix.manage","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":180.0,"y":90.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"гость от qemu / libvirt-qemu","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"сокет RW: root; RO: все","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"polkit: org.libvirt.unix.manage","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":180.0,"y":90.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"гость от qemu / libvirt-qemu","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n3","x":180.0,"y":122.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"machine.slice → machine-qemu…scope","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[7.9,20.0,31.2]}]},{"title":"XML домена: голова","sub":"Глава 24 · Python как слой управления","short":"XML","main":"Тип, имя, память с единицей, vCPU, загрузка, режим CPU.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Имя","Память","vCPU","Загрузка"],"ca